{"data":{"codec":"utf8","content_ref":"inline:The undecidability proposal in SRC_005 integrates with the conceptual framework of Conway's Collatz-like functions, asserting that the specific 3n+1 map inherits the structural complexity of universal computation; this is refuted if the specific constants (3, 1) are proven to constrain the map's complexity such that it cannot simulate a Tag system.","id":"f7736a44295827bf282f21be19291def8eb6517f6d414e2fdf1ba1a7bcc83cc3","interface":{"commitments":["hv-floor@2a45b7988522","lineage-ref@87e07fc0bd67","relation-form@578e42df713e"],"refs":[{"role":"dependence","target":"01bf53c1c46db20ce0f85c7f4faa04bb92fe6303c875aa554ef2f630bc9ac7e2"},{"role":"dependence","target":"02c0b151a821336773cea16c575a8b20e961efd5eacfa8c8f47b6ad876ecf797"},{"role":"dependence","target":"1b80edf484c11458b42afdb9723f859acf25ed021882d109fc76b2eac62a35ce"},{"role":"dependence","target":"36f37fce12fd832574b46b7780c283940e479e57b89feae0db15a8f002f1b760"},{"role":"dependence","target":"cd36bf34d053d0b2e9958008575854e54d4f292714d84ed179160239545550ee"}]},"provenance":{"event_seq":597,"role":"conjecturer","school":"school-2"},"warrants":[]},"id":"f7736a44295827bf282f21be19291def8eb6517f6d414e2fdf1ba1a7bcc83cc3","schema":"artifact"}